nt to hear it.\n\n#BlackLivesMatter","media":null,"username":"jessmfla","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":18,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":18,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":7.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1291446831587700738","date":1596739893000,"rawContent":"@ToddIngram9 @Sportsnet @matt_dumba They didn't even show it at all in the US. \ud83d\ude21\n\n#BlackLivesMatter","media":null,"username":"jessmfla","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":19,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":18,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1295576970760159232","date":1597724595000,"rawContent":"@TheDemocrats @DrBiden @BillClinton @RepAOC @SenSchumer @SallyQYates Can someone please tell me why Bill Clinton is speaking? Lifelong Dem woman here &amp; this upsets me. This is a betrayal of #MeToo &amp; is just awful. \n\nAnd can we get some young speakers? I'm in my 50s, &amp; these people make me tired. They are wonderful, but we want young ppl voting.","media":null,"username":"jessmfla","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":19,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1298735256489656323","date":1598477589000,"rawContent":"Maybe instead of posting pics of dogs we've all seen, #NHL teams &amp; players could instead be tweeting about how they've listened, learned and now support #BlackL